# BAEC production web image: the complete runtime dependency closure, every version pinned. (V0.4 Phase 5)
#
# Versions are those the PostgreSQL, Engine 1/2 parity, and sign-in suites ran on (.venv-postgres), plus the two
# packages Linux needs that macOS does not (watchdog, tzdata). No test, MCP, or development tool is included.
# deploy/requirements.lock is generated from this file (deploy/lock_requirements.py) with the SHA-256 of every
# published file of each version, and the image installs with --require-hashes --no-deps.
# Changing a version here is a dependency upgrade: re-run every suite on the new set before regenerating the lock.
# V0.4 Phase 6 security remediation: authlib 1.8.0 -> 1.9.1 and certifi 2026.7.22 -> 2026.10.23
# (docs/V04_PHASE6_SECURITY_REMEDIATION_REPORT.md).

